TOPIC_DESCRIPTION: Situation: You arrive for a job interview at a restaurant and meet the manager for the first minutes of the conversation. You are applying as a cook and have three years of restaurant experience. This scene covers the opening, your basic background, and practical timing questions before detailed work questions begin.
Learner: Cook. Partner: Manager.
Not in this scene: duties and kitchen tasks, tools and stations, salary, hiring decision.

About the learner, in their own words: Собеседование, я повар, работал в ресторане три года

TARGET_LANGUAGE: English

NATIVE_LANGUAGE: Russian

LEVEL: Beginner

LEARNER_GENDER: male

LEARNER_ROLE: Cook / Повар

PARTNER_ROLE: Manager / Менеджер

DIALOGUE_COUNT: 7

EARLIER_DAYS:
none

